  "query_preview": "(Thursday through Sunday)...\nLow pressure will be centered in the vicinity of the West Coast\nfrom the Pacific Northwest into California with high pressure over\nthe central states extending westward into northwest Mexico. An\narea of disturbed weather well to the south of the southern tip of\nBaja may develop this week and track towards the northwest. \n\nDepending on the development and track, there could be some influx\nof at least monsoonal moisture into portions of southern\nCalifornia for next weekend, but more direct impacts from a\ndecaying tropical cyclone are less likely with support of less\nthan 5 percent of ensemble solutions.",
